+## Board Publication
+
+Account administrators can publish and unpublish boards so anyone with the secret public URL can view them.
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Only account admins can publish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the updated board JSON including `public_url`.
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Only account admins can unpublish a board.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
